{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地股市連日下跌，四大指數收市跌幅約百分之1至3。 </p><p></p><p>深圳創業板指數曾挫百分之4，收市跌幅略為收窄至近百分之3。並連同深證成分指數，見逾一個月低位。滬深京三市成交，約1.6萬億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>算力硬件和半導體板塊受壓。</p><p></p><p>航運股下跌，中遠海能和招商輪船A股跌停板。</p><p></p><p>白酒及券商股逆市上升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T10:00:29.321175+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T11:37:51.219850+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T09:57:43.940599+00:00","content_hash":"56df35c0e2a50cd047ca9250adf6701749ad7c10e91948f635a7761ed5a2b1cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}